          automatics: [ { name: "8-Speed Automatic Sport (ZF 8HP45)", torqueLimit: "500 Nm", oilType: "ZF Lifeguard 8", note: "The incredibly fast, smooth, and intelligent transmission. It perfectly manages the 450Nm of torque. A Stage 1 tune pushes this transmission to its absolute limit, making an xHP flash highly recommended." } ]
