          automatics: [ { name: "8-Speed Automatic Sport (ZF 8HP70)", torqueLimit: "700 Nm", oilType: "ZF Lifeguard 8", note: "The incredibly fast, smooth, and intelligent transmission. It flawlessly manages the massive 600Nm of twin-turbo torque. Highly tuned N63s will push this transmission to its limit, making an xHP flash mandatory." } ]
